&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an innovative, highly technical, and partner-centric &lt;strong&gt;Partner Account Manager, AMER&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Global Partner Sales team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will recruit, activate, and scale strategic SI, MSP, and VAR partner relationships to drive technical alignment and co-sell motions across the Americas region. Acting as a trusted technical advisor, you will integrate JFrog’s DevSecOps IP into partner ecosystems and enable scalable software delivery practices for enterprise customers. Your leadership will directly extend our market reach across the US, Canada, and LATAM, ensuring modern enterprises experience continuous, secure, liquid software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Partner Account Manager, AMER in JFrog you will...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiting, qualifying, and engaging strategic SI, MSP, VAR, and reseller partners to expand JFrog’s market reach across the Americas ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Activating new and existing partners by building practice competency, driving technical onboarding, and accelerating initial proof-of-concept deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scaling partner-influenced pipeline by aligning partner service offerings with JFrog IP and hyperscaler co-sell motions across AWS, Azure, and GCP ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executing ongoing technical enablement and product roadmap alignment workshops to maintain partner technical credibility and high NPS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating closely with regional sales teams, product marketing, and partner technical leads to design and write the Americas partner playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving partner satisfaction and long-term engagement across key regional hubs, spanning the US, Canada, and LATAM markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be a Partner Account Manager, AMER in JFrog you need...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
