&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Sales Engineering, Solutions Architecture, or Technical Pre-Sales within enterprise software, DevOps, or SaaS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record navigating and building technical relationships within the Americas partner ecosystem (SIs, VARs, MSPs, and hyperscalers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or near-native English fluency, with professional proficiency in Spanish and/or Portuguese strongly recommended to cover LATAM.&lt;/li&gt;
