&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a proactive, collaborative, and results-driven Senior Talent Acquisition Coordinator to join our North America Talent Acquisition team. In this role, you will manage interview logistics, facilitate seamless communication, and partner closely with recruiters and hiring managers. If you are highly organized, thrive in a dynamic environment, and love being the connective tissue that brings top talent into an organization, this role is for you!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Senior Talent Acquisition Coordinator at JFrog you will . . .&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Candidate Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the complete interview lifecycle, delivering high-touch, culture-first experiences for applicants and hiring teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organization &amp;amp; Scheduling:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven mastery of complex, multi-time-zone calendar management with the ability to multitask under tight deadlines and pivot quickly when schedules shift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations &amp;amp; ATS Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive global talent acquisition infrastructure by managing and optimizing recruiting systems, Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS), and internal CRM knowledge management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Design &amp;amp; SOPs:&lt;/strong&gt; Create, implement, and document scalable Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) tailored to the unique talent market trends of the technology sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Track trends and talent activity; optimize talent systems to enhance candidate management and process flows. Track recruitment metrics and generate regular reports on time-to-fill, source effectiveness, and pipeline health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Workflows &amp;amp; TA Projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Design compliant, automated AI workflows—from job intake to interviewing—while managing multiple strategic projects.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be a Senior Talent Acquisition Coordinator at JFrog you need . . .&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Requires 5–7 years of experience in recruitment support, HR administration, or high-volume operational roles, demonstrating data-driven excellence in logistics and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly skilled in Applicant Tracking Systems (like Greenhouse), advanced Google Workspace/Excel, AI-native platforms, and analytical data tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Business Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional cross-functional communicator capable of handling candidate outreach, market research, and delivering a high-touch, empathetic experience to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
