&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT JFROG CAN OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive base salary&lt;/strong&gt; $110k - $125k, based on your skills, qualifications, experience, and location — base salary is just one part of your total compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity&lt;/strong&gt; through restricted stock units (RSUs), plus eligibility for our Employee Stock Purchase Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive benefits&lt;/strong&gt; — medical, dental, vision, retirement, wellness, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
